      "cooked": "<p><span>An Ambuscade drabble</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>___</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>He was a star, was&nbsp;</span><em>the</em><span>&nbsp;star, in the prime of life and shooting the greatest film of his career. He was the hero, all enemies fell before his flashing weapons. He was amazing, was adored.</span></p><p>Someone yelled \"Cut!\" and he flinched.</p><p>A makeup girl looked at him oddly.</p><p>\"Your face...\"</p><p>He snatched her mirror, saw the wound on his cheek. It spread, scarred, a mass of ugly flesh hiding his beauty. The mirror shattered, but people’s eyes were mirrors, he couldn't escape and everyone could see his ugliness and he wanted to vanish-</p><p>He woke, tears in his eyes.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>___</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>(Just something to keep me going while I'm working on a Darkwatch story. It's fun to cause make Ambuscade suffer! :P)</p>",
